1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Birth: 	Nov. 16, 1902 Varhaug, Hå kommune, Rogaland fylke, Norway Death: 	Feb. 5, 1968
2 CONT
2 CONT Daughter of Tollak Ueland Ueland and Ingeborg Gurine Ommundson Ueland. 
2 CONT
2 CONT Family links:  Spouses:
2 CONT   Sven Semson Odland (1888 - 1949)*
2 CONT   Peder (Petter) Undem (1904 - 1955)*
2 CONT
2 CONT  Children:   Gunvald Ueland (1925 - 2013)*
2 CONT
2 CONT *Calculated relationship
2 CONT
2 CONT Burial: Union Cemetery, Calgary, Calgary Census Division, Alberta, Canada Plot: Section Y
2 CONT
2 CONT Created by: Deb  Record added: Feb 15, 2014  Find A Grave Memorial# 125183049   Find-A-Grave information added by Wm. Keith Johnson on May 17, 2018    Not sure who added information below regarding her father & family.
2 CONT
2 CONT Note: below is regarding Emma Uelands father: Tollak Ommundson Ueland, son of Ommund Tollakson Ueland and Rakel Serine Ivarsdotter, was born on 25. Oct 1859 in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 10. Nov 1859 in Varh
2 CONC aug kyrkje, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR, died on 19. Jan 1920 in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR at age 60, and was buried on 23. Jan 1920 in Varhaug kyrkje, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR. The cause of his death was Nervefeber.  Noted events i
2 CONC n his life were:
2 CONT
2 CONT • He is mentioned in the 1865-census in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT • He is mentioned in the 1900-census on bruk nr. 1 in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Tollak Ommundson married Ingeborg Gurine Tolleivsdotter on 13. Mar 1890 in Varhaug kyrkje, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR.
2 CONT
2 CONT Children from this marriage were:
2 CONT
2 CONT           i.  Ingvald Svendson Ueland (Relationship to Father: Step, Relationship to Mother: Biological) (Illegitimate) was born on 8. Nov 1888 in Vigrestad, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR and was christened on 2. Dec 1888 in Varhaug kyrk
2 CONC je, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR. Another name for Ingvald was Ingvald Svendsen. 
2 CONT          ii.  Rakel Ueland was born on 23. Nov 1890 in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR and was christened on 26. Dec 1890 in Varhaug kyrkje, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR. Another name for Rakel was Rakkel. 
2 CONT         iii.  Tabitha Ueland was born on 9. Aug 1892 in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR and was christened on 18. Sep 1892 in Varhaug kyrkje, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR. Another name for Tabitha was Tabitta. 
2 CONT          iv.  Tomine Ueland was born on 27. May 1894 in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR and was christened on 24. Jun 1894 in Varhaug kyrkje, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR. Another name for Tomine was Tommine. 
2 CONT           v.  Ommund Ueland was born on 29. Apr 1896 in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 25. May 1896 in Varhaug kyrkje, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1979 in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR at age 83, and was bu
2 CONC ried on 9. Mar 1979 in Varhaug kyrkje, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT          vi.  Thomas Bernhard Ueland was born on 22. May 1898 in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 19. Jun 1898 in Varhaug kyrkje, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR, died in 1979 in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR at age 81, a
2 CONC nd was buried on 26. Jan 1979 in Varhaug kyrkje, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR. Another name for Thomas was Thommas Bernhard. 
2 CONT         vii.  Gurine Ueland was born on 8. Nov 1900 in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR and was christened on 26. Dec 1900 in Varhaug kyrkje, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR. 
2 CONT        viii. ''' Emma Ueland was born on 6. Nov 1902 in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR, was christened on 26. Dec 1902 in Varhaug kyrkje, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR, and died in 1968 in Strathmore, Wheatland, AB, CAN at age 66.''' 
2 CONT          ix.  Gabrielle Ueland was born on 2. Jul 1905 in Ueland, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR and was christened on 2. Aug 1905 in Varhaug kyrkje, Varhaug, Rogaland, NOR.  1         x.  Sigve Ueland 
